{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "retainpdf/contracts/library-documents/v1",
  "title": "书库契约（Library Documents）",
  "description": "书（文档）、合集、全文检索、阅读入口、翻译覆盖、书的文件清单、元数据建议的请求和返回。生产者：backend/packages/retainpdf-core/src/models/library.rs（DocumentRecord / CollectionRecord / BlockSearchHit，库里存的记录）、backend/packages/retainpdf-library/src/views.rs（请求体、查询参数、列表和删除结果）、merge/reading.rs（DocumentReadingView）、merge/coverage.rs（TranslationCoverageView）、media.rs（DocumentFilesView）；消费者：@retainpdf/contracts/library-documents 生成 DTO（前端以后用它换掉 frontend/packages/api/src/documents.ts、collections.ts、search.ts 里手写的类型）。所有响应为 {code, message, data} 信封，本契约描述 data 部分。键的写法照 Rust 实际序列化：类型是 [\"x\", \"null\"] 的键总在、空时是 null；没写进 required 的返回键是空时整个省掉（不是 null）。请求体和查询参数都是 additionalProperties: false，对应 Rust 的 deny_unknown_fields（不认识的字段 400）。Rust 侧由 backend/api/src/api_tests/library_documents_contract.rs 对真实接口的返回钉键集合，并把请求类型的字段集合和这里对上。改契约先改本文件，再重新生成 DTO 并让两端测试变绿。",
  "base_path": "/api/v1",
  "endpoints": [
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/documents",
      "client_name": "listDocuments",
      "transport": "json",
      "query": "ListDocumentsQuery",
      "output": "DocumentListView",
      "rust_view": "DocumentListView",
      "ts_consumer": "@retainpdf/contracts/library-documents :: DocumentListView",
      "note": "书列表，按 added_at DESC, document_id DESC。带 job_id 时是另一种查法（只按任务找它所属的书，最多一条），其余参数不起作用，limit 照样校验。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/documents/:document_id",
      "client_name": "getDocument",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "DocumentRecord",
      "rust_view": "DocumentRecord"
    },
    {
      "method": "PATCH",
      "path": "/api/v1/documents/:document_id",
      "client_name": "patchDocument",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "PatchDocumentInput",
      "output": "DocumentRecord",
      "rust_view": "DocumentRecord",
      "note": "改书名会把 title_source 设成 user 并锁住（title_locked=true），之后自动元数据建议不再覆盖。"
    },
    {
      "method": "DELETE",
      "path": "/api/v1/documents/:document_id",
      "client_name": "deleteDocument",
      "transport": "json",
      "query": "DeleteDocumentQuery",
      "output": "DocumentDeleteResultView",
      "rust_view": "DocumentDeleteResultView",
      "note": "删书、它名下的全部任务（含 -ocr 子任务）、上传和磁盘文件。运行中的任务要 force=true；别的书的任务还在用它名下任务的产物时 409（job_has_dependents），force=true 也跳过这项检查。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/documents/:document_id/reading",
      "client_name": "getDocumentReading",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "DocumentReadingView",
      "rust_view": "DocumentReadingView",
      "note": "阅读器该打开哪个任务。多次范围翻译拼成的是虚拟任务 merged-<文档>-<指纹>，按需生成合并目录。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/documents/:document_id/translation-coverage",
      "client_name": "getTranslationCoverage",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "TranslationCoverageView",
      "rust_view": "TranslationCoverageView",
      "note": "只计算合并计划，不生成合并目录。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/documents/:document_id/files",
      "client_name": "listDocumentFiles",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "DocumentFilesView",
      "rust_view": "DocumentFilesView",
      "note": "书本身的文件清单。取文件本身走 GET /api/v1/documents/:document_id/files/:name 和 /files/pages/:page，返回的是文件，不在本契约里。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/documents/:document_id/metadata-suggestions",
      "client_name": "listMetadataSuggestions",
      "transport": "json",
      "query": "ListDocumentMetadataSuggestionsQuery",
      "output": "DocumentMetadataSuggestionListView",
      "rust_view": "DocumentMetadataSuggestionListView"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/documents/:document_id/metadata-suggestions",
      "client_name": "createMetadataSuggestion",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "CreateDocumentMetadataSuggestionInput",
      "output": "DocumentMetadataSuggestionView",
      "rust_view": "DocumentMetadataSuggestionView"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/documents/:document_id/metadata-suggestions/:suggestion_id/apply",
      "client_name": "applyMetadataSuggestion",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "ApplyDocumentMetadataSuggestionInput",
      "output": "DocumentMetadataSuggestionApplyView",
      "rust_view": "DocumentMetadataSuggestionApplyView",
      "note": "expected_document_updated_at 和书的 updated_at 对不上时 409。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/search",
      "client_name": "searchLibrary",
      "transport": "json",
      "query": "SearchQuery",
      "output": "SearchResultView",
      "rust_view": "SearchResultView",
      "note": "块级全文检索（原文和译文）。没有 offset，要更多就加大 limit。"
    },
    {
      "method": "GET",
      "path": "/api/v1/collections",
      "client_name": "listCollections",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "CollectionListView",
      "rust_view": "CollectionListView",
      "note": "不分页。"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/collections",
      "client_name": "createCollection",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "CreateCollectionInput",
      "output": "CollectionRecord",
      "rust_view": "CollectionRecord"
    },
    {
      "method": "PATCH",
      "path": "/api/v1/collections/:collection_id",
      "client_name": "patchCollection",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "PatchCollectionInput",
      "output": "CollectionRecord",
      "rust_view": "CollectionRecord"
    },
    {
      "method": "DELETE",
      "path": "/api/v1/collections/:collection_id",
      "client_name": "deleteCollection",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "CollectionDeleteResultView",
      "rust_view": "CollectionMutationResult",
      "note": "合集不存在 404。删合集和它的成员关系、工作区目录，书不动。"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/api/v1/collections/:collection_id/documents",
      "client_name": "addCollectionDocuments",
      "transport": "json",
      "input": "AddCollectionDocumentsInput",
      "output": "CollectionRecord",
      "rust_view": "CollectionRecord",
      "note": "返回加完以后的整条合集。合集或任何一本书不存在 404。"
    },
    {
      "method": "DELETE",
      "path": "/api/v1/collections/:collection_id/documents/:document_id",
      "client_name": "removeCollectionDocument",
      "transport": "json",
      "output": "CollectionDocumentRemoveResultView",
      "rust_view": "CollectionMutationResult",
      "note": "书不在这个合集里 404。"
    }
  ],
  "definitions": {
    "JobStatusKind": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "queued",
        "running",
        "succeeded",
        "failed",
        "canceled"
      ],
      "description": "retainpdf-core models::domain::JobStatusKind（serde rename_all snake_case）。"
    },
    "WorkflowKind": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": [
        "book",
        "ocr",
        "translate",
        "render"
      ],
      "description": "retainpdf-core models::domain::WorkflowKind。"
    },
    "DocumentRecord": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "retainpdf-core models/library.rs :: DocumentRecord —— 一本书。document_id 是原文字节的 sha256。接口返回时 source_pdf_url、cover_url、thumbnail_url 总会填上；只有 active_version_id 在没有时整个键不出现。authors_json、year、doi、last_opened_at 四个键没有功能（审计 A8），留着是为了不破坏旧客户端。",
      "required": [
        "document_id",
        "title",
        "title_source",
        "title_locked",
        "authors_json",
        "year",
        "doi",
        "source_filename",
        "page_count",
        "bytes",
        "active_job_id",
        "reading_status",
        "added_at",
        "last_opened_at",
        "updated_at",
        "source_pdf_url",
        "cover_url",
        "thumbnail_url",
        "has_translation"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "document_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "原文 PDF 字节的 sha256（64 位小写十六进制）。"
        },
        "title": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "书名。刚入库时是去掉扩展名的文件名。"
        },
        "title_source": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "filename",
            "pdf_metadata",
            "ocr",
            "user"
          ],
          "description": "当前书名从哪来：filename（默认，上传文件名）、pdf_metadata / ocr（采用了元数据建议）、user（用户改过）。"
        },
        "title_locked": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "用户手工改过书名后为 true，自动元数据建议不再覆盖。"
        },
        "authors_json": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "未使用，恒为空：恒为字符串 \"[]\"（JSON 编码后的字符串，不是数组），没有写入点。"
        },
        "year": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "未使用，恒为空：恒为 null，没有写入点。"
        },
        "doi": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "未使用，恒为空：恒为空字符串 \"\"，没有写入点。"
        },
        "source_filename": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "最近一次上传这本书时的文件名。"
        },
        "page_count": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "原文页数；读不出来是 0。"
        },
        "bytes": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "原文 PDF 字节数。"
        },
        "active_job_id": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "书卡当前对应的任务：有在排队或在跑的就是它，否则是最好的成功任务（翻译优先于纯 OCR），再否则是最近提交的任务；书里没有任务时是 null。打开阅读器请用 /documents/:id/reading，不要直接用它。"
        },
        "active_version_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "当前已提交的 Agent 文档版本。没有时整个键不出现（不是 null），表示用的是原始上传。"
        },
        "reading_status": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "unread",
            "reading",
            "done"
          ],
          "description": "阅读状态，入库时是 unread。"
        },
        "added_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time"
        },
        "last_opened_at": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "未使用，恒为空：恒为 null，没有写入点。"
        },
        "updated_at": {
          "type": "string",
          "format": "date-time",
          "description": "书的信息最后一次变化的时间；采用元数据建议时当版本护栏用。"
        },
        "source_pdf_url": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "原文 PDF 的绝对地址（…/api/v1/documents/:id/files/source.pdf?download=1）。Rust 里为空时省略键，但接口返回总会填。"
        },
        "cover_url": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "封面图绝对地址（…/files/cover.jpg，第一次请求时生成）。Rust 里为空时省略键，但接口返回总会填。"
        },
        "thumbnail_url": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "缩略图绝对地址（…/files/thumbnail.jpg，第一次请求时生成）。Rust 里为空时省略键，但接口返回总会填。"
        },
        "has_translation": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "有没有成功的、带译文（非纯 OCR）的任务，即能不能对照阅读。读时由 SQL 现算，不保证输出 PDF 还在磁盘上。"
        }
      }
    },
    "DocumentListView": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "views.rs :: DocumentListView。",
      "required": [
        "documents",
        "total",
        "limit",
        "offset",
        "has_more"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "documents": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/DocumentRecord"
          }
        },
        "total": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "符合筛选条件的总数，不受 limit / offset 影响。带 job_id 时是 0 或 1。"
        },
        "limit": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 500,
          "description": "生效的 limit：没传是 50，越界 400（不夹），所以总等于请求的值。"
        },
        "offset": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "has_more": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "这一页之后还有没有（offset + 这一页条数 < total）。带 job_id 时恒为 false。"
        }
      }
    },
    "ListDocumentsQuery": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "views.rs :: ListDocumentsQuery（deny_unknown_fields）。GET /api/v1/documents 的查询参数，不认识的参数 400。",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "limit": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "maximum": 500,
          "default": 50
        },
        "offset": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "default": 0
        },
        "reading_status": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "只列这个阅读状态的书（unread / reading / done）。"
        },
        "collection_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "只列这个合集里的书。"
        },
        "job_id": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "按任意 job_id（含历史任务、merged- 虚拟任务）找它所属的书。带它时其余参数不起作用（limit 照样校验）。"
        },
        "q": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "书名或原始文件名包含它（大小写不敏感）。搜正文用 GET /api/v1/search。"
        }
      }
    },
    "PatchDocumentInput": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "views.rs :: PatchDocumentInput（deny_unknown_fields）。两个字段都可选，传 null 等于不传。",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "title": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "新书名，去掉首尾空白后 1 到 512 个字符，否则 400。改了以后 title_source=user、title_locked=true。"
        },
        "reading_status": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "unread",
                "reading",
                "done"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "description": "别的值 400。"
        }
      }
    },
    "DeleteDocumentQuery": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "views.rs :: DeleteDocumentQuery（deny_unknown_fields）。拼错的 force 是 400，不会悄悄变成不强删。",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "properties": {
        "force": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "description": "名下运行中的任务先取消再删。"
        }
      }
    },
    "DocumentDeleteResultView": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "views.rs :: DocumentDeleteResultView。",
      "required": [
        "deleted",
        "document_id",
        "removed_jobs",
        "removed_paths"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "deleted": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "书的那一行删掉了。"
        },
        "document_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "removed_jobs": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "description": "一起删掉的任务编号（含 -ocr 子任务）。"
        },
        "removed_paths": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "description": "删掉的目录，是服务器上的绝对路径（审计 A8）。只用来排查，客户端不要依赖它。"
        }
      }
    },
    "DocumentReadingView": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "merge/reading.rs :: DocumentReadingView。",
      "required": [
        "job_id",
        "merged",
        "contributing_job_ids"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "job_id": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "阅读器该打开的任务；多次范围翻译拼成的是 merged-<文档>-<指纹>。null 表示还没有可读的译文。"
        },
        "merged": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "是不是多次翻译拼成的。"
        },
        "contributing_job_ids": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "description": "拼成这份译文的任务，按页序首次出现的顺序；不是合并时就是那一个任务，没有译文时是空数组。"
        }
      }
    },
    "CoverageSegment": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "merge/coverage.rs :: CoverageSegment —— 连续几页来自同一个来源。",
      "required": [
        "first",
        "last",
        "job_id"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "first": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "description": "第一页（1 起）。"
        },
        "last": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 1,
          "description": "最后一页（含）。"
        },
        "job_id": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "这几页的译文取自哪个任务；null 表示原文（没翻译）。"
        }
      }
    },
    "CoverageJobView": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "merge/coverage.rs :: CoverageJobView —— 这本书的一个任务。所有键总在，没有值时是 null（不是省略）。",
      "required": [
        "job_id",
        "workflow",
        "status",
        "created_at",
        "finished_at",
        "model",
        "pages",
        "supplied_pages",
        "ocr_reused",
        "note",
        "kept_origin_blocks",
        "kept_origin_blocks_supplied",
        "failure_summary",
        "error_head"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "job_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "workflow": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/WorkflowKind"
        },
        "status": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/JobStatusKind"
        },
        "created_at": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "finished_at": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ]
        },
        "model": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "翻译模型；纯 OCR 任务是空字符串。"
        },
        "pages": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "description": "这个任务处理的文档页（1 起、升序）。成功的翻译任务按实际执行算，没完成的按请求算；老任务算不出来是空数组。"
        },
        "supplied_pages": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "当前合并结果里有几页取自这个任务（被后来的翻译盖掉的不算）。"
        },
        "ocr_reused": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "复用了别的任务的 OCR。"
        },
        "note": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "成功但有额外说明（目前就是「N 个内容块保留原文未翻译」），和任务列表的 completion_note 同一个来源；没有是 null。"
        },
        "kept_origin_blocks": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "成功的翻译任务里该翻却保留原文的内容块数；读不到是 0。"
        },
        "kept_origin_blocks_supplied": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "上面那些块里，落在当前合并结果仍取自这个任务的页上的块数；旧任务没有逐块记录时等于 kept_origin_blocks。"
        },
        "failure_summary": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "失败原因一句话（中文）。只有失败任务有，别的是 null。"
        },
        "error_head": {
          "type": [
            "string",
            "null"
          ],
          "description": "原始错误的第一行（截到 160 字）。只有失败任务有，别的是 null。"
        }
      }
    },
    "TranslationCoverageView": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "merge/coverage.rs :: TranslationCoverageView —— 书籍详情「进度」。",
      "required": [
        "page_count",
        "translated_pages",
        "contributing_jobs",
        "segments",
        "jobs"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "page_count": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0
        },
        "translated_pages": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "有译文的文档页数。"
        },
        "contributing_jobs": {
          "type": "integer",
          "minimum": 0,
          "description": "当前合并结果用到了几次翻译。"
        },
        "segments": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/CoverageSegment"
          },
          "description": "整本书按页的来源，连续同源的页合成一段。"
        },
        "jobs": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/CoverageJobView"
          },
          "description": "这本书的全部任务，新到旧。"
        }
      }
    },
    "DocumentFileEntryView": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "media.rs :: DocumentFileEntryView。",
      "required": [
        "name",
        "url",
        "content_type",
        "ready",
        "on_demand"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "name": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "source.pdf",
            "cover.jpg",
            "thumbnail.jpg"
          ]
        },
        "url": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "绝对地址（…/api/v1/documents/:id/files/<name>）。默认在浏览器里打开，加 ?download=1 下载。"
        },
        "content_type": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ready": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "原文在磁盘上。只有书在、原文不在时是 false（书不在是 404）。"
        },
        "on_demand": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "description": "按需生成：第一次请求时才生成，会慢一些。"
        }
      }
    },
    "DocumentPagesView": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "media.rs :: DocumentPagesView —— 原文页预览图。",
      "required": [
        "url_template",
        "page_count"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "url_template": {
          "type": "string",
          "description": "把 {page} 换成页码（1 起）：…/api/v1/documents/:id/files/pages/{page}.jpg。"
        },
        "page_count": {
          "type": [
            "integer",
            "null"
          ],
          "minimum": 1,
          "description": "页数；不知道（书的 page_count 是 0）时是 null。"
        }
      }
    },
    "DocumentFilesView": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "media.rs :: DocumentFilesView —— 书本身的文件。files 固定三项：source.pdf、cover.jpg、thumbnail.jpg。",
      "required": [
        "document_id",
        "files",
        "pages"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "document_id": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "files": {
          "type": "array",
          "items": {
            "$ref": "#/definitions/DocumentFileEntryView"
          }
        },
        "pages": {
          "$ref": "#/definitions/DocumentPagesView"
        }
      }
    },
    "DocumentMetadataEvidenceView": {
      "type": "object",
      "description": "views.rs :: DocumentMetadataEvidenceView。除 source 外的键没有时整个不出现（不是 null）。",
